  m_Name: Carta_MutiraoHabitacional
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Mutir\xE3o Habitacional"
  _titleEn: Self-Build Housing
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Fam\xEDlias organizadas constroem juntas as pr\xF3prias casas, com projeto,
    terreno e material pagos pelo poder p\xFAblico e decis\xF5es tomadas em assembleia."
  _summaryEn: Organized families build their homes together, with design, land and
    materials paid for by the government and decisions made in assemblies.
  _realWorld: "Na gest\xE3o de Luiza Erundina em S\xE3o Paulo (1989 a 1992), cerca
    de 8 mil moradias foram erguidas em mutir\xE3o autogerido, com as fam\xEDlias
    cuidando da obra e do dinheiro."
  _realWorldEn: "Under Mayor Luiza Erundina in S\xE3o Paulo (1989 to 1992), about
    8,000 homes were built by self-managed crews, with the families running both
    the work and the money."
  _tradeOffs: "A obra \xE9 mais lenta, pede trabalho volunt\xE1rio nos fins de semana
    e apoio t\xE9cnico, e em S\xE3o Paulo muitas fam\xEDlias ficaram anos sem o documento
    do im\xF3vel."
  _tradeOffsEn: "Construction is slower and takes weekend volunteer work and technical
    support, and in S\xE3o Paulo many families went years without a title to their
    homes."
  _sources:
  - Label: "C\xE2mara Municipal de S\xE3o Paulo, mutir\xF5es de autogest\xE3o (2013)"
    Url: https://www.saopaulo.sp.leg.br/blog/movimentos-sociais-querem-a-volta-dos-mutiroes-de-autogestao/
